File: src/fit_field_base.cpp
Function: FieldBase::GetOffset
One decode of the test corpus takes about 358.373 ms.
The code below currently runs at 0.923891 of the original SDK's decode time; the best found so far is 0.920641.

Rewrite this function to make decoding faster:
```cpp
FIT_FLOAT64 FieldBase::GetOffset(const FIT_UINT16 subFieldIndex) const
{
    if (subFieldIndex == 0xFFFF)
        return GetOffset();

    if (subFieldIndex >= GetNumSubFields())
        return GetOffset();

    auto subfield = GetSubField(subFieldIndex);
    return NULL != subfield ? subfield->offset : 0.0;
}
```
